The '''Ravaged Caravan'''{{co|54|48|Mulgore}} is a ruined [[Venture Company]] camp on the northeastern shore of [[Stonebull Lake]]. The [[caravan]] is what's left of a conflict between the [[tauren]] and the Venture Co. after the tauren saw them traveling throughout [[Mulgore]].<ref>[[The Ravaged Caravan (Horde) (1)]]</ref> The caravan's initial goal was to deliver more supplies to [[Supervisor Fizsprocket|Supervisor Fizsprocket's]] mining endeavor.<ref>[[Venture Co. Documents]]</ref> It now sits on a mound, spewing out black smoke. The remaining company aggressively defends the smoldering remains of their precious cargo.

